 LSTM neural networks in predicting different target sequences. Moreover, the GRU neural network required less training epochs for predicting the sequence \"hello world\" perfectly as compared to the simple RNN and LSTM neural networks. However, the simple RNN and LSTM neural networks could predict the target sequence perfectly with fewer recurrent units than the GRU neural network. Overall, these results may provide insights into how the nervous system optimally encodes sequences of items.  ","topics":[],"score":180790,"global_rank":402572},{"name":"sgabriel92/DVD_Rental_SQL","owner":"sgabriel92","html_url":"https://github.com/sgabriel92/DVD_Rental_SQL","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Set of SQL queries to answer intersting of questions","topics":[],"score":180790,"global_rank":402573},{"name":"jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","owner":"jstoecker","html_url":"https://github.com/jstoecker/dxcompute-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Survey of DX12 compute topics","topics":[],"score":180790,"global_rank":402574},{"name":"dmason82/CS193pFlickr","owner":"dmason82","html_url":"https://github.com/dmason82/CS193pFlickr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":"CS 193p HW 4","topics":[],"score":180787,"global_rank":402575},{"name":"CourtHans/Vagrant-based-LAMP-stack-creation","owner":"CourtHans","html_url":"https://github.com/CourtHans/Vagrant-based-LAMP-stack-creation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":180786,"global_rank":402576},{"name":"chrisdruta/soundcloud-true-shuffle","owner":"chrisdruta","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisdruta/soundcloud-true-shuffle","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Chrome plugin to fix soundclound desktop website shuffle functionality","topics":[],"score":180786,"global_rank":402577},{"name":"msimerson/67